    "Name": "Hazard",
    "Details": "Exclusively fielded by the Circinus Federation, the Hazard HZD-2A was designed and built with the aid of the Word of Blake. Retaining the 225-rated fusion core and DHS of the HZD-2, the 2A adds an XL Engine. The additional free weight allows for the inclusion of CASE protected ammo bays and 5 Jump Jets. 4 Medium Lasers constitute the majority of the designs ranged firepower, while a Beagle Probe allows it to finally excel at Infantry hunting. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Distracting</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.03</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
